WEBVTT

00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:33.065
Second of all, there’s this notion
of self-driving shuttles,

00:02:33.065 --> 00:02:35.693
but frankly, they are optimized for many.

00:02:35.818 --> 00:02:39.030
They can’t take you specifically
from point A to point B.

00:02:39.363 --> 00:02:42.033
OK, now we have --

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.618
hm, how am I going to say this --

00:02:43.618 --> 00:02:47.205
the so-called “personal, 
self-driving” cars of today.

00:02:47.955 --> 00:02:53.336
Well, the reality is that those cars
still require a human behind the wheel.

00:02:53.878 --> 00:02:55.213
A safety driver.

00:02:55.213 --> 00:02:56.714
Make no mistake about it.

00:02:56.714 --> 00:02:57.924
I own one of those,

00:02:57.924 --> 00:02:58.966
and when I’m in it,

00:02:58.966 --> 00:03:00.343
I am a safety driver.